// the rest, and the academy's payments to the Admin are recorded. Replaces the per-doctor share,
// the per-course percent, and payouts to doctors.
// Generated by Payload, then edited by hand:
//   - the payouts constraint is dropped with "IF EXISTS" (dropping the table with CASCADE
